# Reduce with several axes inside a polymorphic function keeps its axis
# meaning, and its identity follows the element type (R1, T6).
== SOURCE
u:t_otal := { '+ r_/_12 _r }
u:t_otal 2 2 r_eshape 1 2 3 4
u:t_otal 2 2 r_eshape 0.5
u:t_otal 0 2 r_eshape 1.5
== TYPE
u:t_otal : Num a => a -> a
Int
Float
Float
== RESULT
10
2.0
0.0
